OL,3,GNEWSAThe Meta glasses revolution - is
OL,4,Ait okay to film people in public?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's the latest wearable tech boom that
OL,7,Fis likely coming to a street, park or
OL,8,Ftown square near you. But not everyone
OL,9,Fsees the future of smart glasses as
OL,10,Frose-tinted.
OL,12,FThe technology allows users to make
OL,13,Fcalls, interact with AI hands-free and
OL,14,Falso take photos and videos simply by
OL,15,Ftouching the frames, provoking concerns
OL,16,Fabout privacy.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
