OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThe Meta glasses revolution - is
OL,4,Ait okay to film people in public?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWetherspoons, which runs almost 800
OL,7,Fpubs across the UK, has banned using
OL,8,Fthe glasses to film inside its premises
OL,9,Fand women's rights campaigners have
OL,10,Fraised issues about their potential use
OL,11,Ffor harassment.
OL,13,FBut, with videos from content creators
OL,14,Fcontinuing to thrive on social media
OL,15,Fplatforms like TikTok and Instagram,
OL,16,Fthe debate of how to best use the
OL,17,Fglasses in public places will continue
OL,18,Fto go back and forth.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
